ry time. The code crosses your Wi-Fi unencrypted, so anyone there who sees or guesses it can connect. Wrong tries lock it for longer each time, up to an hour.␀␀␀␀Mesh console␀␀␀␀File Transfer␀␀␀Upload, download, or delete files from a browser on the same Wi-Fi.␀http://%s:8765/files␀␀␀␀Session code␀␀␀␀Stop File Transfer␀␀That app is not installed any more␀␀[SPEC] %lu us/bin, tick %lu us -> %d bins/tick (was %d, budget %lu us)
